# Tag control 2: the whole TCI of the tag a report has is replaced by the
# profile's (priority 3, VID 300: 0x612c), an untagged one gets it added.
# Then tag control 3: only the VID is replaced, the host's priority kept.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=1
us_tag_control=2
us_tci=24876
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 10 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
2 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.2
3 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=1
us_tag_control=3
us_tci=24876
end
4 tick
